</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/67a75952-8351-11f1-bfc1-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-19T060713Z-967321404-RC2TGMAQYFZT-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-ATTACK-KYIV.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/67a75952-8351-11f1-bfc1-005056a90284/w:1024/p:16x9/2026-07-19T060713Z-967321404-RC2TGMAQYFZT-RTRMADP-3-UKRAINE-CRISIS-ATTACK-KYIV.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">1b6d3638-83a1-11f1-86a9-5fc224a83ff1</guid><pubDate>Sun, 19 Jul 2026 18:39:12 GMT</pubDate><dc:creator>肖曼</dc:creator></item><item><category>欧洲</category><title>德国基民盟政治家施潘因美国代孕事件辞职</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2/20260719-%E5%BE%B7%E5%9B%BD%E5%9F%BA%E6%B0%91%E7%9B%9F%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB%E5%AE%B6%E6%96%BD%E6%BD%98%E5%9B%A0%E7%BE%8E%E5%9B%BD%E4%BB%A3%E5%AD%95%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E8%BE%9E%E8%81%8C</link><description>
