</description><media:thumbnail url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/52484644-4bce-11f1-a248-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26129571902826.jpg"/><enclosure url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/52484644-4bce-11f1-a248-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26129571902826.jpg" type="image/jpeg" length="0"/><guid isPermaLink="false">63b79468-829a-11f1-8d8f-952aa7b6bac4</guid><pubDate>Sat, 18 Jul 2026 11:32:36 GMT</pubDate><source url="https://s.rfi.fr/media/display/52484644-4bce-11f1-a248-005056bf30b7/w:1024/p:16x9/AP26129571902826.jpg">© 美联社图片</source><dc:creator>弗林</dc:creator></item><item><category>欧洲</category><title>乌克兰公布摩纳哥爆炸瞬间的视频</title><link>https://www.rfi.fr/cn/%E6%AC%A7%E6%B4%B2/20260717-%E4%B9%8C%E5%85%8B%E5%85%B0%E5%85%AC%E5%B8%83%E6%91%A9%E7%BA%B3%E5%93%A5%E7%88%86%E7%82%B8%E7%9E%AC%E9%97%B4%E7%9A%84%E8%A7%86%E9%A2%91</link><description>
